	<section_number>32.1-49</section_number>
	<catch_line>Tuberculosis required to be reported</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Board shall include tuberculosis in the list of diseases provided for in § 32.1-35 which are required to be reported.
	</text>
	<history>1979, c. 711.</history>
